    "message": "No longer maintained: WPF support was removed in Uno Platform 6.7 (last stable version: 6.6.184).\nTo run your app on Windows, use the desktop target (net10.0-desktop) of an Uno.Sdk project, which uses the Win32 host.\nHosting Uno Platform content inside a WPF app (Uno Islands) has no replacement.",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
